<p>This 43 second dashcam clip is the kind of thing that makes traffic safety teams sigh and insurance adjusters reach for pain relief. It captures an OPP police chase on Highway 401 near Whitby involving two modified tuner cars and a high performance sport motorcycle performing a brief stunt and some very aggressive lane changes. The footage is short and chaotic but it is also a precise micro lesson in what makes highway pursuits so dangerous.</p>
